    <rule name="Repair" id="daf06136-987e-24b6-2082-826bb94f0efe" hidden="false" page="0" publicationId="d5d7c4c4--pubN67466">
      <description>If a Flyer is affected by a Locked Velocity result, then in subsequent turns a repair can be attempted in their Shooting phase rather than firing any weapons. Roll a D6 and on the result of 6, the Locked Velocity result no longer applies.</description>
    </rule>
