    <rule name="Strafing Run" id="05138154-c5cd-1abb-33fe-25e1699c590c" hidden="false" page="42" publicationId="d5d7c4c4--pubN110258">
      <description>When shooting Assault, Heavy, Rapid Fire or Salvo weapons at Artillery, Beasts, Bikes, Cavalry Infantry, Monstrous Creatures and vehicles without the Flyer or Skimmer type, this vehicle has +1 Ballistic Skill. Regardless of the target, the vehicle&apos;s shots also have the Pinning special rule.</description>
    </rule>
