      <description>1 Siege Breaker
2 Burner of Worlds
3 Fortress Destroyer
4 Master of Timing
5 Lord of Precision
6 Strategic Attacker</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Warlord Trait: Planetstrike Defender" id="7fd4900f-cbd2-08dc-6966-d4fcfd445a28" hidden="true" publicationId="d5d7c4c4--pubN112957">
      <description>1 Protector of Worlds
